Build cm_rust for Fuchsia only, without test deps (milestone M9b).

On host, upstream builds it with //src/sys/lib/bitflags-serde-legacy and serde (feature
serde): outside pilot 1's closure (docs/closure/pilot1.json: this crate is used from
Fuchsia code only). The host branch is emptied and the target marked Fuchsia-only.

test_deps are dropped: //rules:rustc.bzl makes no unit tests until milestone M16, and
regen.py would otherwise fetch crates outside the closure (difference, and on host
serde_json).

The added lines are the overlay's (Apache-2.0); the context lines are Fuchsia's
(BSD-2-Clause, LICENSES/BSD-2-Clause.txt). Applied by scripts/regen.py to the rewritten
BUILD.bazel.

--- a/src/sys/lib/cm_rust/BUILD.bazel
+++ b/src/sys/lib/cm_rust/BUILD.bazel
@@ -39,14 +39,8 @@
         ":cm_rust_derive",
         "@rust_crates//vendor:strum_macros",
     ],
-    test_deps = [
-        "@rust_crates//vendor:difference",
-    ] + select({
-        "//rules:is_host_os": [
-            "@rust_crates//vendor:serde_json",
-        ],
-        "//conditions:default": [],
-    }),
+    # Overlay: unit tests are milestone M16 (patch 0001).
+    test_deps = [],
     visibility = [
         "//vendor/fuchsia:__subpackages__",
     ],
@@ -66,12 +60,12 @@
         "@rust_crates//vendor:strum",
         "@rust_crates//vendor:thiserror",
     ] + select({
-        "//rules:is_host_os": [
-            "//vendor/fuchsia/src/sys/lib/bitflags-serde-legacy",
-            "@rust_crates//vendor:serde",
-        ],
+        # Overlay: no host build (patch 0001).
+        "//rules:is_host_os": [],
         "//conditions:default": [],
     }),
+    # Overlay: Fuchsia only (patch 0001).
+    target_compatible_with = ["@platforms//os:fuchsia"],
 )
 
